        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Moses Harman\n- Products: Lucifer the Lightbearer\n- Topics: women's rights, individualist anarchism\n\nFacts:\n- Moses Harman was born on October 12, 1830, and he died on January 30, 1910.\n- Moses Harman was an American schoolteacher and publisher.\n- Moses Harman was notable for his staunch support for women's rights.\n- In the late 19th and early 20th centuries, Moses Harman published Lucifer the Lightbearer.\n- Lucifer the Lightbearer was an individualist anarchist journal.",
